## description of what was run, for what purpose
Broad Modal A100 perf grid to identify FA2 vs SDPA crossover (torch 2.5.1+cu121, flash-attn 2.8.3 cp310). Cases swept over batch {1,2,4}, heads {16,32,64}, seq {512,1024,2048,4096,8192,12288}, dim=64, with total elems capped at 120M. Warmup=2, iters=5.

### command
source .venv/bin/activate && cd unsloth && modal run modal_attention_flash_ampere.py::perf_grid

